# The two fixed palettes are written by devtools/art_assets/rpg.py but are
# BUILD INPUTS: tileset.png.toml and interior.png.toml impose them. The
# repo-wide ignore rules (*.pal) would drop them, and the example would not
# build from a clean clone. Negate the ignore rather than relying on
# `git add -f`, which any later `git add -A` silently undoes.
!town_fixed.pal
!interior_fixed.pal

# opensnes-level's outputs of the two maps: written by every build
*.q16
*.m16
*.c16
*.b16
*.o16
*.t16
